[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]州泰[/color]：昶麾下执行者，袭巫秭归房陵[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]王浑（子）[/color]：继承衣钵，西晋平吴功臣，昶之遗泽延续至晋代[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
